"""Icon paths for the Night Shrine cards: brand logos and hand-drawn glyphs.

Every icon is a single inline path on a 24x24 viewBox, so SVGs shown as <img>
on GitHub need no external references.

Sources and licences:
  * Brand logos: Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), CC0-1.0. Paths and
    brand hex values were taken verbatim from the simple-icons npm package.
    OpenAI, Amazon Web Services and LinkedIn are no longer listed in
    simple-icons' data file, so their hex values are the last published ones;
    the paths still come from the simple-icons icon files. Trademarks belong to
    their owners; logos are shown only to name the tool.
  * devicon (MIT) was checked as a fallback but was not needed.
  * Nmap and Whisper have no Simple Icons or devicon logo; "Nmap" is a plain
    monogram N and "Whisper" a waveform, both drawn by hand.
  * GLYPH (lock, globe, torii, bell, star, fork, mail, can-do and link icons):
    hand-drawn for this project. Link icons for LinkedIn, X, Instagram,
    Hugging Face, TryHackMe and Gmail reuse the brand paths.
"""
